ret>\n     <exc> NoExc </exc>\n     <exit-code> 0 </exit-code>\n+    ensures antiShuffle(INPUT) ==K ?OUTPUT\n endmodule\n*** End Patch\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019fae8d-923b-7eb2-84d6-7e857283807a"}}}
